Subject: Cancel queued reflection capture when a retained instance leaves its scenario

The scenario-removal branch must unlink pending capture like base destruction
already does. Re-entry culling queues a fresh capture from step zero.
Exact before/after source hashes in the build recipe guard this insertion.

--- a/servers/rendering/renderer_scene_cull.cpp
+++ b/servers/rendering/renderer_scene_cull.cpp
@@ -854,0 +855,5 @@
+				// A retained instance can leave its scenario while capture is queued.
+				// Retire that work before its owner loses the scenario below.
+				if (reflection_probe->update_list.in_list()) {
+					reflection_probe_render_list.remove(&reflection_probe->update_list);
+				}
